Third-party code and ideas
--------------------------
x3book/epaper.py re-implements, in Python, these ideas from
bigbag/epub-to-xtc-converter (cli/optimizer.js), https://github.com/bigbag/epub-to-xtc-converter :
  - removing embedded font files (and their OPF manifest items)
  - removing CSS float / position / flex / grid / transform, and @font-face blocks
  - converting GIF / WebP / BMP / TIFF images to baseline JPEG and rewriting references
  - replacing base64 data: URIs in src attributes
No JavaScript code from that project is included or executed.

